<p>Activating this talent enhances your reflexes to incredible levels.  Each time you are attacked in melee, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 19%, 23%, 26%, 28%</acronym> chance to fire off a defensive shot off in time to intercept the attack, evading it and dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">37%, 45%, 50%, 55%, 60%</acronym> archery damage.</p><p>This cannot damage the same target more than once per turn.</p>